{"id":1151101,"name":"Evie - Interrogation I","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"Evie - Interrogation I","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1151101]}],"trial":{"trial_id":151101,"stage":"Phase 1","unlock_time":"2026-10-08 14:00:00","diary1":"Following the Phanuel incident, the MBCC has been monitoring Mania responses among the personnel involved. Recently, Sinner Evie's M-value has shown abnormal fluctuations, accompanied by clear signs of physical exhaustion.\nYou initiate an interrogation targeting her according to protocol, hoping to contain the deterioration before it causes her Mania to flare up.","diary2":"Through the interrogation, you learn that Evie was recently invited by Mimi-meow's talent agent to participate in promotional activities as a fan, and that she has been using her ability during performances without permission. Despite feeling unwell, she continues to endure the exhaustion, ignoring the possible threat it poses.\nThis is no accident. Evie's family has instilled in her the belief that self-sacrifice is a prerequisite for earning love, even at the expense of her physical health. A few words from you won't change how she operates. To truly eliminate the risk of her ability spiraling out of control from overexertion, perhaps a meeting with the figure at the center of her world—Mimi-meow—is inevitable.","evidence":[{"ID":260979,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260980,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":16,"dialogue_id":251101001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":7,"dialogue_id":251101002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251101003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251101004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":3,"dialogue_id":251101005,"next":[6]},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251101006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251101007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251101008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"d